   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protect Environment for our Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The increasing of population with increasing of deforestation while reforestation and afforestation are not taken very serious ways to increase the number of trees is the big problem. From the light statistics I can find we can have an increase of 1,000,000,000 trees every 10 to 14 years equal to an average of about 83,333,333 trees per year due to the average estimate of the world population increase in 2011, 2023 and 2037 if there will be planting trees comparing to the increase of people.</narrative>
  </description>
